<title>USA: Mauna Loa Macadamia Partners Q3 net higher.</title>
<headline>Mauna Loa Macadamia Partners Q3 net higher.</headline>
<dateline>HONOLULU 1996-11-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>MAUNA LOA MACADAMIA PARTNERS, L.P.</p>
<p>				  Income Statements</p>
<p>		     (In Thousands, Except Per Unit Data)</p>
<p>				Three Months Ended  Nine Months Ended</p>
<p>					   September 30,  September 30,</p>
<p>					  1996	1995   1996    1995</p>
<p> Macadamia nut sales	    $4,255    $3,860 $6,316  $6,495</p>
